{"id":"vod_bf_4166","vodId":"4166","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"唱K小鱼仙第一季","name_cn":"唱K小鱼仙第一季","date":"2003-01-01","year":"2003","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-5/a3da12be6dc33abdcbca5a846be95e99.jpg"},"summary":"露西亚，来自北太平洋的美人鱼公主，登陆寻找她七年前由海中拯救的男孩，当时这位男孩溺水了，她用粉红色的真珠救了他一命，并且把她最珍贵的粉红色珍珠交给那位男孩。七年后她为了继承一事来到了陆地去寻找以前的男孩要回真珠，最终找到了那个男孩，名叫堂本海斗，但是化身成人形的露西亚，名叫七海露西亚的女孩，与她的人鱼型态并不相似；她也不能告诉海斗她真正的身份，否则她将变成泡沫。因此她努力的让海斗去想出她的真正身份。　　与此同时，露西亚知道有一群水妖已经入侵海上世界。她必须聚集七位美人鱼公主和她们的真珠，使得传说中的海洋女神阿克安·雷芝娜女神复活，并阻止水妖们的阴谋。为了这样，她与另外六位来到陆地的美人鱼公主波音、莉娜、香莲、诺爱儿、可可和沙罗联手，使用她们的珍珠变成歌唱偶像，以她们的歌声作为攻击武器去对付水妖。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 17:13:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":52,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/changKxiaoyuxiandiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/changKxiaoyuxiandiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/changKxiaoyuxiandiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/changKxiaoyuxiandiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/changKxiaoyuxiandiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/changKxiaoyuxiandiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/changKxiaoyuxiandiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/changKxiaoyuxiandiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/changKxiaoyuxiandiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/changKxiaoyuxiandiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/changKxiaoyuxiandiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/changKxiaoyuxiandiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"